sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Referral Source
    participant Intake as Intake User
    participant Clinician as Clinician Reviewer
    participant Legal as Legal Instrument Layer
    participant Ledger as Custody Ledger
    participant Facility as Receiving Facility

    Caller->>Intake: Referral / crisis details
    Intake->>Ledger: Case created event
    Intake->>Clinician: Assessment draft
    Clinician->>Ledger: Assessment reviewed event
    Clinician->>Legal: OPC/PEC/CEC draft if applicable
    Legal->>Ledger: Legal draft created
    Legal->>Legal: Authorized signature / attestation
    Legal->>Ledger: Signed + hash-sealed event
    Intake->>Facility: Packet transmitted
    Ledger->>Ledger: Transmission event hash
    Facility->>Intake: Accept / decline / more info
    Facility->>Ledger: Response receipt event
    Intake->>Ledger: Verify chain
